43
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:06,370
So first, there is an injury
to the endothelium. This

44
00:02:06,370 --> 00:02:09,270
can be either internally,
like a plaque breaks off

45
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:12,290
from somewhere and damages
