occurring outside the body.

47
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:21,350
Then we move into primary
hemostasis, and then we

48
00:02:21,350 --> 00:02:25,930
have secondary hemostasis,
which consists of two

49
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:28,530
