75
00:03:44,070 --> 00:03:47,070
The endothelium also
releases tissue factor

76
00:03:47,070 --> 00:03:50,010
pathway inhibitor,
which does the same as

77
00:03:50,010 --> 00:03:52,750
those. They inactivate
different factors.

78
00:03:53,530 --> 00:03:58,450
And then lastly, there's
TPA, which we know as a

79
00:03:58,450 --> 00:04:01,150
drug mostly, but it's also
commonly found in the body.

80
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:04,030
It's released from the
endothelium, which initiates

81
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:06,970
