of fibrin that would

82
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:10,210
stabilize a clot. So under
normal conditions, your

83
00:04:10,210 --> 00:04:12,810
body just wants blood to
flow smoothly and they're

84
00:04:12,810 --> 00:04:15,470
not trying to stop the
platelets or make a plug.

85
00:04:16,530 --> 00:04:21,550
But then when we have an
injury, that's when the

86
00:04:21,550 --> 00:04:25,390
