begins. So that injury to the

87
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:28,750
endothelium then exposes
the subendothelial collagen

88
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:31,620
that's exposed before.
That's kind of the orange

89
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:34,130
