97
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:03,330
The exposed collagen binds
von Willebrand factor.

98
00:05:03,330 --> 00:05:06,350
This is a protein that
promotes platelet adhesion.

99
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:09,290
It can come from a few
different places. It's in

100
00:05:09,290 --> 00:05:11,830
