granule, so definitely

105
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:25,710
know that alpha granule
in the weibol piloti

106
00:05:26,590 --> 00:05:32,050
bodies. So once that von
Willebrand factor has bound

107
00:05:32,050 --> 00:05:35,290
to the exposed collagen,
the next step is going

108
00:05:35,290 --> 00:05:39,730
to be platelet adhesion. So
