112
00:05:50,210 --> 00:05:53,790
It slows down the blood
so that these receptors

113
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:56,110
have a chance to bind to
the von Willebrand factor.

114
00:05:57,510 --> 00:06:00,210
Next is activation.
Once the platelets have

115
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:02,270
