162
00:08:35,070 --> 00:08:37,450
All right, so now we're
going to move on to secondary

163
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:39,820
hemostasis. This is also
known as the coagulation

164
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:42,580
cascade. I know it looks
a little intimidating

165
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:46,120
this is just an overview
