00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:11,280
10, those first four are
what we're looking at here.

194
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:14,720
And then it's called
a cascade because once

195
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,580
the first one's
activated, it goes on to

196
00:10:16,580 --> 00:10:19,120
