injury to the vessel

214
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:16,840
wall and you have blood
loss after that. So think

215
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:21,120
extrinsic external
injury. So you're damaging

216
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,800
