not just the endothelium.

217
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:27,620
So factor two is found in
the deeper layers of the

218
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:31,220
vessel wall. So that's also
helpful to have you think

219
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:33,640
about external because
that's what's going to be

220
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:36,860
exposed when this kind of
damage occurs. It's going to

221
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:39,400
be the muscle cells in
the fibroblast, which is a

222
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:43,920
much deeper injury. The
important factor here, we have

