of factor 7 you have.

235
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:28,900
All right, so we made it
to the common pathway. So

236
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:33,200
this is the last step of
each pathway results in

237
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:36,000
activation of factor 10, and
